Subject: Extracting p-values from advanced.procD.lm() as data frame
Message-ID: <MLUWNBMolis.g0DRDgszAgAJ@geomorph-r-package.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/geomorph-r-package/c/MLUWNBMolis/m/g0DRDgszAgAJ>
